{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WqrQMFw0AF1795734824.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>宏安集團截至9月底止中期轉虧為盈，純利9,520萬元，上年度同期蝕超過3.5億元。</p><p></p><p>毛利3.58億元，增長一成九，主要受期間交付物業的毛利率改善，以及有關物業相關成本下降所致。</p><p></p><p>期內收入跌四成四，至6.69億元，主要受已交付的已竣工住宅單位減少，以及內地物業銷售下降影響。不派中期息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:04:28.882217+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T23:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T02:37:19.178591+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T23:57:37.173796+00:00","content_hash":"f46150566c5f1b2404e31b4184809f3fa1fa5a5e819166cbeb887f1d35dd1fa0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}